  "rationale": "Comparison for unit:shared.typing.normalization against lean:Shared/TypingViews:ValueType, lean:Shared/TypingViews:RawType.normalize, lean:Shared/TypingViews:normalize, lean:Shared/TypingViews:Normalized, lean:Shared/TypingViews:initialPermission. RawType.normalize assigns the declaration's initialPermission to a bare nominal, recursively composes outer permissions, and normalizes the nominal view. sharedStruct therefore remains shared under an outer given. The internal normalize on ValueType normalizes only the already chosen permission's view, which agrees with the distinction between raw and normalized forms. Notation and judgment context was checked in unit:shared.declarations, unit:shared.typing.types, unit:shared.typing.composition, unit:given.typing.normalization.",
